%% Location-dependent query: nearest available parking
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor D as Driver
    participant App as Mobile app
    participant S as Web service
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    D->>App: Open "Find parking" for 10:00-12:00
    App->>App: Get GPS fix (lat, lon, accuracy, observedAt)
    alt fix older than 2 min or accuracy > 100 m
        App->>App: request fresh fix (max 5 s), else use last fix + warning
    end
    App->>S: GET /facilities/nearby?lat&lon&observedAt&radiusM=1000&from&to
    S->>DB: active facilities in bounding box + free spaces for period
    DB-->>S: rows
    S->>S: haversine distance, filter radius, sort ascending
    S-->>App: 200 {query{position, observedAt, distanceModel}, generatedAt, results}
    App->>App: cache results with generatedAt
    opt driver moved > 100 m since observedAt (migration of response)
        App->>App: discard outdated result
        App->>S: reissue GET /facilities/nearby with the new fix
        S-->>App: 200 new results
    end
    App-->>D: list "based on your position at 09:41, updated 09:41"
